---
const columns = [
  {
    label: 'Propuesto',
    dot: 'bg-gray-500',
    tasks: [
      { title: 'Landing page B2B — draft de copy', agent: 'Strategy Agent' },
      { title: 'Secuencia de outreach — 200 leads', agent: 'Outreach Agent' },
    ]
  },
  {
    label: 'En curso',
    dot: 'bg-cyan animate-pulse',
    tasks: [
      { title: 'Optimización de campaña LinkedIn Ads', agent: 'Paid Agent' },
      { title: 'Dashboard de atribución en GA4', agent: 'Analytics Agent' },
      { title: 'Scoring de leads en el CRM', agent: 'RevOps Agent' },
    ]
  },
  {
    label: 'Completado',
    dot: 'bg-purple',
    tasks: [
      { title: 'Automatización de lead qualification', agent: 'Automation Agent' },
      { title: 'A/B test de pricing page', agent: 'Strategy Agent' },
    ]
  }
];
---

<section id="agentes" class="relative py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-light">Así trabajan</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Mientras vos dormís,<br class="hidden sm:block" /> <span class="gradient-text">tus agentes siguen ejecutando</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-gray-400">
        Cada agente trabaja un sistema de growth a la vez. Vos ves el estado en tiempo real, yo reviso cada entrega antes de que salga en vivo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {columns.map((column, ci) => (
        <div class={`animate-fade-in-up delay-${(ci + 1) * 100}`}>
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 px-1">
            <span class={`inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full ${column.dot}`}></span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400">{column.label}</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-gray-600">{column.tasks.length}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {column.tasks.map(task => (
              <div class="gradient-border card-hover p-4">
                <div class="relative z-10">
                  <p class="text-sm text-white leading-snug">{task.title}</p>
                  <span class="mt-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-cyan/10 border border-cyan/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan">
                    {task.agent}
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
